    "description": "Complete REST API collection for QA Training - Project Management System.\n\n## How to Use\n1. Set up environment with `baseUrl` variable\n2. Run \"Register User\" to create an account\n3. Run \"Login\" to get JWT token (automatically saved)\n4. Execute Project CRUD operations\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:3000\n- `authToken`: JWT token (auto-populated after login)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
